e how my brother was and whether I liked my new job in London.","start":48.22,"end":53.33,"score":0.994,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-048-007","sourceId":"b2-048-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"In answer to these questions I either nodded or made strange noises.","start":54.91,"end":60.39,"score":0.972,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-048-008","sourceId":"b2-048-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Meanwhile, my tongue was busy searching out the hole where the tooth had been.","start":61.4,"end":66.96,"score":0.926,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-048-009","sourceId":"b2-048-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I suddenly felt very worried, but could not say anything.","start":68.65,"end":72.29,"score":0.961,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-048-010-p01","sourceId":"b2-048-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"When the dentist at last removed the cotton wool from my mouth,","start":73.66,"end":77.75,"score":0.916,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-048-010-p02","sourceId":"b2-048-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[12,26],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I was able to tell him that he had pulled out the wrong tooth.","start":78.75,"end":83.03,"score":0.87,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
